Package: fvfmR
Type: Package
Title: Chlorophyll Fluorescence (Fv/Fm) Analysis of Leaf Disc Images
Version: 1.0.0
Authors@R: c(
    person("Josef", "Garen", role = c("aut", "cph")),
    person("Pieter", "Arnold", role = c("aut", "cre", "cph"),
           email = "pieter.arnold@anu.edu.au"),
    person("Kristine", "Crous", role = c("aut", "cph"))
  )
Description: Semi-automated analysis of chlorophyll fluorescence images of
    leaf discs taken with a 'Walz' 'IMAGING-PAM' fluorometer. Provides an R
    interface to the 'fvfmPy' 'Python' package, which detects leaf discs,
    assigns them to a grid of rows and columns, and computes the maximum
    quantum efficiency of photosystem II, Fv/Fm = (Fm - Fo) / Fm, for each
    disc. The interactive 'fvfmPy' window is launched from R and the results
    are returned to R as a data frame.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
URL: https://github.com/garenj/fvfmR, https://github.com/garenj/fvfmPy
BugReports: https://github.com/garenj/fvfmR/issues
Encoding: UTF-8
Imports:
    reticulate,
    utils
